    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Shot</strong> is a top-down shooter set in the Wild West.<br>A former sheriff, enraged after his son is kidnapped, heads into the outlaw\u2019s den for revenge.<br>Gear up with a variety of weapons and prepare for one-shot kills.<br>A single mistake means death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One-Shot, One-Kill Gunfights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy dies in a single shot \u2014 but so do you.<br>Equip revolvers, bullets, focused shots, and trinkets to craft your unique loadout.<br>There\u2019s no need to unlock gear. Experiment with all kinds of builds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Cover, No Tricks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All enemies are ready to shoot at you.<br>At least they\u2019re only using guns.<br>There are no walls to hide behind \u2014<br>but luckily, your bullets won\u2019t get stuck either.</p>",
